 "summary": "Four glass-passivated diodes wired as a full-wave single-phase bridge in a flat four-lead through-hole GBU case with a bolt-down hole. Seven voltage grades run from 50 V (GBU6A) to 1000 V (GBU6M) of repetitive peak reverse voltage; all share a 6.0 A average output rating with the case on a heatsink at 90 °C, 3.8 A on a PCB at 40 °C ambient, and 175 A surge. GBU6K-E3/51 is the 800 V grade, RoHS-compliant commercial grade, packed 250 to a paper tray.",
